+ *   <id>_portrait_b      the same from the other side, a little lower
+ *   <id>_headgear        the headwear's own hero angle (profile, rear...)
+ *   <id>_headgear_rear   the headwear from behind
+ *   <id>_idle            full body in the arena, a different frame of 'At Rest' each
+ *   <id>_idle_side       the same frame from the side
+ *   <id>_action          full body in the arena, a clip frame matched to personality
+ *   <id>_action_b        a second personality clip
